t->processing_fee_component,2) }}</td></tr>@endif</tbody></table><h2 style="margin-top:30px">Balance after this payment</h2><dl class="detail-list"><div><dt>Principal</dt><dd>₹{{ number_format($payment->outstanding_principal_after,2) }}</dd></div><div><dt>Interest & penalty</dt><dd>₹{{ number_format($payment->outstanding_interest_after+$payment->outstanding_penalty_after,2) }}</dd></div></dl><div class="signature">Authorised signature</div><div class="receipt-footer">Dhiran · {{ $payment->receipt_number }}<br>This receipt reflects the balance at the time of this transaction. Please retain it for your records.</div></main></body></html>
